#: ../../learn/synchronous.rst:2
msgid "Use it from synchronous code"
msgstr "在同步代码中使用"

#: ../../learn/synchronous.rst:4
msgid "Not every program is async. ``create_agent_sync`` runs the same runtime on one background event loop, so scripts, CLIs, and notebooks can call it from ordinary ``def`` code. Model behavior, tools, extensions, session history, retries, and event types are identical to the async API."
msgstr "并非每个程序都是异步的。\\ ``create_agent_sync``\\ 在同一个后台事件循环上运行相同的运行时，因此脚本、CLI 和 notebook 都可以从普通的\\ ``def``\\ 代码中调用它。模型行为、工具、扩展、会话历史、重试和事件类型都与异步 API 完全一致。"

#: ../../learn/synchronous.rst:10
msgid "Run and stream"
msgstr "运行与流式输出"

#: ../../learn/synchronous.rst:24
msgid "Use the stream as a context manager if you might stop early; closing it cancels the unfinished request and waits for cleanup. Later requests on the same session run normally."
msgstr "如果你可能会提前停止，请把流当作上下文管理器使用；关闭它会取消未完成的请求并等待清理完成。同一会话上的后续请求可以正常运行。"

#: ../../learn/synchronous.rst:29
msgid "Blocking views of async objects"
msgstr "异步对象的阻塞视图"

#: ../../learn/synchronous.rst:31
msgid "Agents, clients, providers, tools, storage, and dispatchers expose ``.sync()``, which mirrors their async methods with blocking calls:"
msgstr "智能体、客户端、模型提供商、工具、存储和分发器都提供\\ ``.sync()``，它用阻塞调用映射它们各自的异步方法："

#: ../../learn/synchronous.rst:46
msgid "For anything else — free functions, third-party clients — use :class:`~zett_agent.sync_runtime.SyncRuntime` directly:"
msgstr "对于其他情况——自由函数、第三方客户端——请直接使用\\ :class:`~zett_agent.sync_runtime.SyncRuntime`："

#: ../../learn/synchronous.rst:58
msgid "Share one runtime for resources that belong together, and close what you own before leaving it. A runtime you pass in explicitly stays open when a view exits."
msgstr "对于应该配套使用的资源，请共享同一个运行时，并在离开之前关闭你自己拥有的部分。你显式传入的运行时在视图退出时仍保持打开。"

#: ../../learn/synchronous.rst:62
msgid "Callbacks and custom models"
msgstr "回调与自定义模型"

#: ../../learn/synchronous.rst:64
msgid "Extension hooks and dispatcher callbacks stay ``async def``; they run on the background loop with the real request context. GUI applications should schedule visual updates through their own UI thread rather than touching widgets from a callback."
msgstr "扩展钩子和分发器回调仍然是\\ ``async def``；它们在后台循环上运行，并带有真实的请求上下文。GUI 应用应该通过自己的 UI 线程安排界面更新，而不是在回调里直接操作控件。"

#: ../../learn/synchronous.rst:69
msgid "If your model is a blocking ``def stream(request)`` generator, wrap it with :class:`~zett_agent.sync.SyncModelAdapter`. Existing ``@tool`` functions already support both styles."
msgstr "如果你的模型是一个阻塞式的\\ ``def stream(request)``\\ 生成器，请用\\ :class:`~zett_agent.sync.SyncModelAdapter`\\ 包装它。现有的\\ ``@tool``\\ 函数已经同时支持这两种风格。"

#: ../../learn/synchronous.rst:74
msgid "Sending input into a running request"
msgstr "向运行中的请求发送输入"

#: ../../learn/synchronous.rst:76
msgid "While a synchronous stream is paused at an :doc:`Ask User <../extending/events>` or Plan Mode event, another thread can deliver the reply with ``agent.emit_external_event(event, config=config)``. Different sessions can run concurrently; overlapping requests for one session are rejected."
msgstr "当同步流暂停在\\ :doc:`Ask User <../extending/events>`\\ 或 Plan Mode 事件上时，另一个线程可以用\\ ``agent.emit_external_event(event, config=config)``\\ 传递回复。不同会话可以并发运行；同一会话的重叠请求会被拒绝。"

#: ../../learn/synchronous.rst:82
msgid "Complete offline example"
msgstr "完整的离线示例"

#: ../../learn/synchronous.rst:87
msgid ":download:`Download the example <../_examples/synchronous.py>`."
msgstr ":download:`下载示例 <../_examples/synchronous.py>`\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/synchronous.rst:90
msgid ":doc:`streaming` for event handling, :doc:`sessions` for persistence, and :doc:`../extending/hooks` for the full hook list."
msgstr ":doc:`streaming`\\ 介绍事件处理，:doc:`sessions`\\ 介绍持久化，:doc:`../extending/hooks`\\ 列出全部钩子。"

